# C8: build output is not source.
#
# Applies to NEW files only. Several build directories, .exe and .obj files are
# already tracked because historical reports and manifests reference them; those
# remain tracked on purpose and must not be removed without an owner decision.

# CMake build trees (any depth)
build/
stark/build/
stark/build-*/
build-*/

# CMake-generated files outside a build tree
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/

# Compiler and linker output
*.exe
*.obj
*.o
*.a
*.lib
*.dll
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.tlog
*.ipdb
*.iobj
*.exp
*.bin.tmp

# Test scratch directory written by the persistence checks (relative to stark/)
stark/build/dev_bin/
build/dev_bin/

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/settings.json
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Python developer tools (no third-party dependencies)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Node dependency trees and generated test output (T-25).
# Dependencies are installed from package-lock.json and never committed.
node_modules/
apex_app/node_modules/
test-results/
apex_app/test-results/
# T-32 Step 2 (2026-11-19): the HUD-experience PNGs and run summary are workflow artifacts, not
# source. The T-31 evidence has the same treatment: the directory ships a README, the run writes
# the rest, and the CI job uploads it.
apex_app/reports/screenshots/t31-browser-run.json
apex_app/reports/screenshots/t31_*.png
apex_app/reports/screenshots/t32/
apex_app/reports/screenshots/t32-hud-run.json
# T-33 Step 4 (2026-11-19): the same treatment for the executive-loop walk. The PNGs and the JSON
# summary are produced by the hosted browser job and uploaded as artifacts.
apex_app/reports/screenshots/t33/
apex_app/reports/t33-executive-loop.json
apex_app/reports/screenshots/t34/
apex_app/reports/t34-mission-dag.json
# T-35, T-36 and T-37 Step 4 (2026-11-21): the same treatment for the three walks that published
# their own summaries. The PNGs and the JSON are written by the run and uploaded as artifacts; only
# the directories' READMEs are source.
apex_app/reports/screenshots/t35/
apex_app/reports/t35-stepdown-handoff-doctor.json
apex_app/reports/screenshots/t36/
apex_app/reports/t36-cold-boot-unseeded.json
apex_app/reports/screenshots/t37/
apex_app/reports/t37-neural-council-router.json
playwright-report/
apex_app/playwright-report/
blob-report/
*.trace.zip
